tmdb_id":8358,"content_type":"series","title":"Lie to Me","title_en":null,"title_fr":null,"original_title":null,"tagline":null,"description":"في الموسم الثاني من المسلسل، يحاول الدكتور لايتهاوس معرفة ما إذا كانت امرأة واحدة أو بضعة أشخاص قد شهدوا على جريمة قتل بعينها، كما يحقق مع زوي في جريمة اغتصاب.","description_en":"The world's leading deception researcher, Dr. Cal Lightman, studies facial expression, body language and tone of voice to determine when a person is lying and why, which helps law enforcement and government agencies uncover the truth. But his skills also make it easier for him to deceive others.","description_fr":"Le chercheur de file au niveau mondial en détection de tromperie, le Dr Cal Lightman, étudie l'expression faciale, le langage corporel et le ton de la voix pour déterminer lorsqu'une personne ment et leur raison, ce qui aide la police et les agences gouvernementales à découvrir la vérité. Mais ses habiletés font aussi en sorte qu'il est facile pour lui de tromper les autres.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2xpQxwsGYtdGDrmLvCosTZ0I54R.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1GY7ih45OzZKjNCJ97XHxBCtuSU.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":7.9,"vote_count":1765,"age_rating":"TV-14","year":"2009","release_date":"2009-01-21","runtime_minutes":44,"status":"Canceled","country":"الولايات المتحدة","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["جريمة","دراما","غموض"],"genre_keys":["crime","drama","mystery"],"similar":["tv5920","tv206529","tv107113","tv2288","tv4607","tv90","tv97951","tv233686"],"director":"Sam Baum","cast":[{"name":"Tim Roth","character":"Cal Lightman","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/qSizF2i9gz6c6DbAC5RoIq8sVqX.jpg"},{"name":"Kelli Williams","character":"Gillian Foster","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6P8MzCm2rgBJFVciaka2r6E6TIt.jpg"},{"name":"Monica Raymund","character":"Ria Torres","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kobJTZoG81lqRZvnBEjjony478Z.jpg"},{"name":"بريندان هاينز","characte