يرة، حيث يبدأ الناجون الباقون في الانتقال عشوائيًا إلى الماضي والمستقبل، وذلك إثر تحريك (بن) للجزيرة في الزمان والمكان، والخط الزمني الثاني يدور خارج الجزيرة عقب موت (لوك)، ويتناول محاولات (جاك) و(بن) للاجتماع مرة أخرى بالركاب الستة والعودة للجزيرة.","description_en":"Stripped of everything, the survivors of a horrific plane crash must work together to stay alive. But the island holds many secrets.","description_fr":"Après le crash de leur avion sur une île perdue, les survivants doivent apprendre à cohabiter et survivre dans cet environnement hostile. Bien vite, ils se rendent compte qu'une menace semble planer sur l'île...","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/og6S0aTZU6YUJAbqxeKjCa3kY1E.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yUOFocKDW7MCC5isx4FK8A68QFp.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":8,"vote_count":5473,"age_rating":"TV-14","year":"2004","release_date":"2004-09-22","runtime_minutes":null,"status":"Ended","country":"الولايات المتحدة","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["غموض","حركة ومغامرة","دراما"],"genre_keys":["mystery","action","drama"],"similar":["tv155173","tv5920","tv2288","tv8358","tv88329","tv274556","tv219971","tv74823"],"director":"جاي جاي أبرامز, دامون ليندلوف","cast":[{"name":"Matthew Fox","character":"Jack Shephard","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6VIfueb4j3GCsIhxnstsXlY5C3Y.jpg"},{"name":"Evangeline Lilly","character":"Kate Austen","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/pJHX2jd7ytre3NQbF9nlyWUqxH3.jpg"},{"name":"تيري أوكوين","character":"John Locke","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kSweOGPprLe1vDvu38wJQaWIih7.jpg"},{"name":"Josh Holloway","character":"James Sawyer","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/biuhUJn5BDhXpfKvVW4dVUxvB44.jpg"},{"name":"مايكل إيمرسون","character":"Benjamin Linus","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xOpr90SF1RCtjFNTu32nZQ90buY.jpg"},{"name":"خورخي غارسيا","character":"Hurley Reyes","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hIt31bI76cvwijImR